<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Acuson raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Acuson raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it upgraded Acuson Corp to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Acuson gained 2-14/16 to 23-7/16.</p>
</text>
